DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Ploni Almoni\, whose 23rd Yahr
 zeit occurs on Tuesday\, December 8\, corresponding to the 28th of Kislev\
 , 5787.\n\nPloni Almoni’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Monday\, Decembe
 r 7 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary 
 to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your lov
 ed one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memo
 ry serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
